---
description: >-
  The same fork/join pattern as v2-should-render-forks-and-joins.mmd
  (`<<fork>>` splitting into State2/State3, `<<join>>` merging into
  State4), but nested inside a composite state (TV) instead of at the top
  level - tests fork/join rendering within a composite boundary.
config:
  logLevel: 0
  fontFamily: courier
---
stateDiagram-v2
  [*]-->TV

  state TV {
  state fork_state <<fork>>
  [*] --> fork_state
  fork_state --> State2
  fork_state --> State3

  state join_state <<join>>
  State2 --> join_state
  State3 --> join_state
  join_state --> State4
  State4 --> [*]
  }
